<title>FINLAND: TABLE-PUUHAMAA FULL YR PROFIT FALLS 28 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-PUUHAMAA FULL YR PROFIT FALLS 28 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to end-April,</p>
<p>				 (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extras, tax		     6.64 vs 9.44</p>
<p> Net sales					  21.95 vs 27.1</p>
<p> Operating profit				  5.05 vs 8.1</p>
<p>NOTE- Full name of Finnish amusement park operator is</p>
<p>Tervakosken Puuhamaa Oy.</p>
